<title>NEW ZEALAND: Ebos lifts first half net by 5.25 percent.</title>
<headline>Ebos lifts first half net by 5.25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  1.41 vs 1.34</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 18.7 vs 18.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  9.0 vs 8.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				   29.66 vs 16.08</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     2.13 vs 2.03</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.73 vs 0.70</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  7.66 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date March 21</p>
<p>Reg date March 14</p>
<p>    Ex div   February 21</p>
<p>Note - Ebos Group Ltd is a drug and medical supplies company.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
